      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَاغَضْتُهُ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُبَاغَضَةٌ</span>, <i>I rendered him</i>
[<i>hatred,</i> or] <i>vehement hatred, reciprocally.</i> (A, *
TA.) You say also, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَيْنَهُمَا مُبَاغَضَةٌ</span> [<i>Between them
two is reciprocal hatred,</i> or <i>vehement hatred</i>].
(A.)

